Network architecture

This is where your earlier decision to make MOS network-oriented becomes extremely valuable.

I wouldn't let workers directly depend on PostgreSQL.

Instead:

             ┌───────────────┐
             │   MOS Node A  │
             └───────┬───────┘
                     │
               MOS Protocol
                     │
        ┌────────────┼────────────┐
        │            │            │
   MOS Node B   MOS Node C   MOS Node D

Each node can have:

┌───────────────────────────────┐
│          MOS NODE             │
│                               │
│  API                          │
│  Runtime                      │
│  Worker Manager               │
│  Retrieval                    │
│  Cache                        │
│  Network                      │
│  Security                     │
│  Telemetry                    │
│                               │
│       PostgreSQL              │
└───────────────────────────────┘

That lets us eventually distribute MOS across machines without changing the conceptual API.
